There is one problem with this. There are things other then the random 
number seed that will effect how things happen in nethack. Things like 
the date, and the time, will have a noticeable effect on the outcome of 
various events. The result is that you won't get "set challenges", you'll 
get "vaguely similar games that could have vastly different challenges".

